You strike your foe with your two handed weapon, dealing [163%, 185%, 202%, 217%, 229% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

If the attack hits, all foes in radius 2 will have their light resistance reduced by [5%, 9%, 13%, 16%, 20% (TL1-5)] and their damage reduced by [1%, 5%, 8%, 11%, 15% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.
